---
import Layout from '../../sites/ey/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="關於本院" current="about">
  <govtw-stack space="6">
    <govtw-breadcrumbs>
      <a href="/ey/">首頁</a>
      <span>關於本院</span>
    </govtw-breadcrumbs>
    <govtw-sidebar side="left" side-width="14rem" space="8">
      <govtw-side-navigation label="關於本院選單">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/ey/about/" aria-current="page">本院簡介</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ey/about/">組織架構</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ey/about/">歷任院長</a></li>
        </ul>
      </govtw-side-navigation>
      <div>
        <govtw-stack space="6">
          <h1>本院簡介</h1>
          <govtw-contents-list>
            <ol>
              <li><a href="#role">一、職權</a></li>
              <li><a href="#organization">二、組織</a></li>
              <li><a href="#contact">三、聯絡資訊</a></li>
            </ol>
          </govtw-contents-list>
          <h2 id="role">一、職權</h2>
          <p>（示範內文）行政院為國家最高行政機關，依憲法規定行使職權。</p>
          <h2 id="organization">二、組織</h2>
          <p>（示範內文）本院設院長、副院長各一人，政務委員若干人，並設各部會。</p>
          <h2 id="contact">三、聯絡資訊</h2>
          <p>（示範內文）聯絡資訊為示範資料。</p>
          <govtw-page-tools></govtw-page-tools>
        </govtw-stack>
      </div>
    </govtw-sidebar>
  </govtw-stack>
</Layout>
